#: scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85795dbbaaf0a6ddb7cf9dd05945def84f6932fca61d6fc3a8013c5d8a75531b
#. default-sha256: 0217aaf0cb17794a877c10228eae6669a066f5580eadb8d09c3409021055db4e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Master... ⟪k:7⟫What are your thoughts on the tale so far? ⟪k:8⟫"
"Which of the siblings do you think was in the right, Master—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫the brother, or the sister?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫자, ⟪k:7⟫주인님……. ⟪k:8⟫주인님께선 ⟪k:9⟫어떻게 보시는지요? "
"⟪k:10⟫맞는 말을 한 건 ⟪k:11⟫오빠일까요, ⟪k:12⟫여동생일까요."

#: scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dda896a062702cddcca156c693fb9a1ab27214683aec1682a76de4c3c150e610
#. default-sha256: 29f38a3592c01db5308fdcd733170eb7a1e227536cc8fa5605099c73fa7a555d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my. I apologize for the abrupt question. ⟪k:1⟫Did I startle you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머…… 갑자기 불러서 ⟪k:1⟫죄송합니다. ⟪k:2⟫놀라셨는지요?"

#: scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3005778643275a1dbda58453f945caab1d38b1738c2c1c6d1b4289317ef59eb8
#. default-sha256: 195b7af34647816c3e57a6085a0dd1f8a8a35937c7de18d5b6e23b98fc447393
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What do I think? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm, yes, I believe Mell was probably right. ⟪k:2⟫He was also surely "
"happier than her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제 의견이요? ⟪k:1⟫그렇지요, ⟪k:2⟫옳은 건 ⟪k:3⟫오빠 쪽일 겁니다. ⟪k:4⟫……행복한 것도 ⟪k:5⟫오빠 "
"쪽이지요."

#: scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea03bad865b2ee85a4bc7148937e8ba05446eddcac98572434295bff50c87606
#. default-sha256: 2d894cce2692f0fe3cb97a0345920853b4687d6cc5d2ab6cda5143c500f7905f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As Mell had anticipated, Nellie fled from the theatre, leaving her fiancé behind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리는 아니나 다를까, ⟪k:1⟫약혼자에게 돌아가지 않고 ⟪k:2⟫극장에서 뛰쳐나왔답니다."

#: scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4586fcc8816847d0b11b2058fbd71eb8fa7f7f41126bf30c7d9118c05c775b74
#. default-sha256: 31b7c7624f098ff32cc3d741e40799c2c840d401c4cf9758ba84de61cf4c39c6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She forced her way into a carriage stopped outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫probably one called for a "
"different nobleman—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and ordered it to take her home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그리고 극장 앞에 대기 중인 마차를―― ⟪k:1⟫아마 ⟪k:2⟫다른 귀인이 타려고 불러 둔 것을 ⟪k:3⟫억지"
"로 타서 저택으로 돌아왔습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdd827ff2f88b1736a0f9a2ef1f783c506925df55f809f1405abad0565a16604
#. default-sha256: e94593cf0f7480ae901f717d975054b62d1e024c19fb017b1afdc380afae6ae1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mell’s assumption was correct: the only place she had to return to was the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫네, ⟪k:1⟫멜이 예상한 대로 ⟪k:2⟫넬리에게는 저택 말고 돌아갈 곳이 없었습니다. ⟪k:3⟫이미 해도 저"
"물기 시작했지요."

#: scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71426a7664c00d0efc8bbce039a873ad31a097f19b5f5dd8695ff3efe085fa10
#. default-sha256: 310ad1623935998076c1bfdb03be901f540e2c091d453246d4ebdac8c5bcc496
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun was beginning to set, and as a young lady, she could not simply go wandering through "
"town alone..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리는 여자라서 ⟪k:1⟫마음 편히 다른 곳에 들르질 못 했고……"

#: scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a157b82ace299a1a0366b5b35464a45aa1721ee9783c83b255de9c74ac8f2bd2
#. default-sha256: 0b41cde018ba92f93021633bba0d6bada2bf3ff2854148d92d2c5aa8ca121947
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫nor did she have any acquaintances to take her in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫찾아갈 지인도 ⟪k:1⟫없었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5102f2767584884bac489e6e1e59206bf36b30586c5843f9035f60d21c47bd57
#. default-sha256: dd4f915a2fa9fca0e6106bf1287922625b2377ce425baaa60b46925bd2dff2f0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her world was, in essence, composed of two elements: her brother and the rose garden. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They were the light of her life at Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫넬리의 세계는 ⟪k:1⟫오빠와 ⟪k:2⟫장미 정원, ⟪k:3⟫두 곳만으로 구성되어 있었습니다. ⟪k:4⟫장미 저"
"택의 활기. ⟪k:5⟫그 상징."

#: scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: affec5bb6da1e2d0c38fe0e527ae7b32ec1cfd2c9c7fcf50b3550af51276b922
#. default-sha256: ae77a7bb46133dd7d9752df242d153bdc2cdb9767e68372ba43af06045307338
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She lived a very... ⟪k:2⟫isolated existence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫매우―― ⟪k:2⟫폐쇄적이었지요."

#: scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19076d18908891d6c774b263f8b3180c49813d34482e00d9896cc82e58defe4f
#. default-sha256: c3d75f1a9f29e2f3e3a34e69ebc72ec3dca406145193c4b863c54cc7486e0e3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫……으, ⟪k:15⟫하"
"아…… 하아!"

#: scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7905a1c5c28cd26728d575232d425fab569dc9a551bca2730482470340d958f2
#. default-sha256: 665d521c46e4028e31140c445e2edec25300551b55615a9ed65b76cc3c61c7ea
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫N-⟪k:3⟫Nnh... ⟪k:4⟫nnnnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫으, ⟪k:3⟫으으, ⟪k:4⟫……흑……."

#: scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68e56f8601cb813b3f5e3539a5906ae05535c50c9b23bc9c0b9f6775db2e45a6
#. default-sha256: d63abafa389705e55166a31d261e9f03c45b1d168705b86679bbdedbfcea17ce
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F8AB5E67_7037_4224_AB7C_700B0CAAA4CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When she escaped back home, Nellie went straight to her room, locked the door, and "
"began sobbing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저택으로 돌아온 넬리는 ⟪k:2⟫방에 뛰어들어갔습니다. ⟪k:3⟫그리고 문을 잠가 ⟪k:4⟫오열을 흘"
"렸답니다."

#: scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a8bac338e4b7023e454de3bf1a7c4d9a469c7e7d68c63810ae98d1f290dc09e
#. default-sha256: daf9d53844dd889cb018ed7c431c09fac36cd3d08646104115faf081f1d4c448
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0C668EF_842A_47D6_BE44_D88B4989EA41"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The waves of her sorrow came crashing effortlessly over the levees."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫넬리의 슬픔에 찬 해일은 ⟪k:1⟫방파제를 금세 넘었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77c066e0e05b5b0cdf0aa7dafcb7ce63348152bcc3b573fd75e31cba74d85f35
#. default-sha256: 225343ea4f30ae29cf6d332b08b9a6c318f4d0c3b24302541339321ff3c871ad
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C53DB2DA_FA3D_46A2_B1F5_2C04ACCAB047"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tears streamed through the cracked walls of the dams blocking her tear ducts."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫무너진 눈물의 둑에서 금세 ⟪k:1⟫눈물이 흘렀지요……."

#: scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dedc3792d2e692cf481469d70efcbed9e160749a2c46bb2561bf11b2a822e0b6
#. default-sha256: 346c26ee1adfbe9070c8f9a0848054ee5f3288b1ee7b55460e47ed70b0275b33
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D1156FF3_8A4D_4CA6_B1E9_1CC2AA1D5D8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mnh, ⟪k:3⟫w-⟪k:4⟫waaaah...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Why... ⟪k:7⟫whyyyy?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫흑, ⟪k:3⟫으…… 으으……. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫왜…… 대체 왜……!"

#: scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99eeb7548f6edacd0a1951647e94ff378a6fc6f51e215c94aa6aaf5e8a55ac88
#. default-sha256: e047d62963085f6b8e4ae9efa4c9bb688c327a87befb4d4fabeec6866c1bfec1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4FD5280C_D2E4_41C6_84F8_3EFF0F211A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why won’t you help me, Mell...?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why won’t you take my side...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜…… 오라버니는 도와 주질 않지……?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫왜…… 내 편으로 있어 주질 않지……?"

#: scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c86e290d70b92cbc6b473a2a9892b28aee01e6160838b1c4820168e99b620f0
#. default-sha256: 56c211a51063e93e425ef094e3c509d9e33cad81d2d4b860e325da787a0a20c9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CD837617_0249_467E_B012_5B7224AF6386"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The decor in her room appeared blurry through her damp eyes. ⟪k:1⟫Memories of the day she "
"had it redecorated played back in her mind with crystal clarity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫눈물로 흐려진 넬리의 시야에 ⟪k:1⟫방의 인테리어가 보였습니다. ⟪k:2⟫새록새록 떠오르는 ⟪k:3⟫리"
"폼 날."

#: scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e8cf756f471761000928b70fd6b2bbc5880a145146c84c11719f3b6e805c531
#. default-sha256: f8d6fe5b80cf3168f2b5bffaf21ed73e2bb45107547cd0c8550043ae1aee3ab8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_431871F8_0EF3_4EB2_AC86_087BD5C0D022"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She told me... ⟪k:2⟫she had no feelings for you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫오라버니한테…… 그런 감정 없다고…… 했잖아!"

#: scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e952e59892cd4fa29ccf40623f52c8b5c94e73e66bd2a889341dbc97820512dc
#. default-sha256: a79c7b44c583333554cdee145fc97ec9ae3978f66ac274a564ffac6cae71c26f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7881CD7C_0E4C_4F4B_95F8_62EC1FBEBEE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That liar!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That liar!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫거짓말쟁이――, ⟪k:2⟫거짓말쟁이!!⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2217170e374635a9f60e72e45e6e63f0f281278ad582bb2a7c54924ccad3b49
#. default-sha256: feb2efba7b5fd8252a8a18d69559fdc4be2c507ba8dc57b9aca4950fc942e00d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BE9D3E3A_EC16_4BC5_8528_3DAA68428BC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She let her emotions run wild, breaking glass craftworks, silver plates designed by famous "
"foreign artisans, flower vases, all sorts of things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫넬리는 충동에 떠밀려 ⟪k:1⟫섬세한 유리 공예품과 ⟪k:2⟫유명한 모양이 그려진 수입 은접시, ⟪k:3⟫꽃"
"병 등―― ⟪k:4⟫다양한 것을 부수었습니다."

#: scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6610b266ea5f816a1232fcfee7d9abf3713edef82ae5c84fd310b8bf2ce8d1ba
#. default-sha256: 4260ebc075499b42231d98e28fad5353bca00cf103501ebe9134078617f84428
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_179DAB7F_3499_4FDB_B483_45B8EC775B27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though a beast had been set loose in her bedchamber."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫정신이 나간 것처럼 ⟪k:1⟫끝도 없이."

#: scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb65c6001a80c90442a5c04217d62b661baa3ec5a69a0c5951a1d8a025de7816
#. default-sha256: 382b8b4d64c4719a0d9cc9e88aa14e8d71e2f69e1d7cc40900545be669293b73
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B812073A_9A8A_4DBD_8F0D_DE0CA1D9310D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—!⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫―――읏!⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dda4926b6aa4289882f4899041c04031b572afa971cdf7cb583577333d54bc54
#. default-sha256: 83ab855e5e15a2002c322e8f0a49a0f741b5cc79fbd7b37c91db30038e8ecc11
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_30ECB1CF_30F8_4DF3_B4AB_9E1A23286DDF"
msgid ""
